<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The single-price unlock surface, Russian.

  The key set is identical to `values/strings_unlock.xml`; a key present in one tree and not the other
  is a failure `scripts/core/policy.mjs` reports in both directions. The price note names no number for
  the same reason the English note does not: the localized price is shown by Google Play itself.
-->
